\section{Default Landscape Metrics}{


The following landscape-level metrics are calculated using \pkg{landscapemetrics}:
\itemize{
\item \code{lsm_l_area_mn}: mean patch area;
\item \code{lsm_l_area_sd}: standard deviation of patch area;
\item \code{lsm_l_cohesion}, cohesion index;
\item \code{lsm_l_condent}: conditional entropy;
\item \code{lsm_l_core_cv}: coeff var of core area;
\item \code{lsm_l_core_mn}: mean core area;
\item \code{lsm_l_core_sd}: std dev of core area;
\item \code{lsm_l_ed}: edge density;
\item \code{lsm_l_iji}: interspersion and juxtaposition index;
}
}

\section{Default Patch Metrics}{


